                <div class="mb-4">
                  <img src="./assets/img/logos/nasa.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px;">
                </div>
                <p class="card-text fs-3"><em>"PyFR has been a game changing tool for investigating complex turbulent flow phenomenon in the wake of reentry capsules and predicting their dynamic stability characteristics. It’s capability to run on modern GPU supercomputers has been an enabler for running high-fidelity scale resolving simulations in a matter of hours, which would otherwise have taken many weeks to months to perform using legacy CFD tools."</em></p>
              </div>

              <div class="card-footer pt-0">
                <h6 class="mb-0">Rathakrishnan Bhaskaran</h6>
                <span class="card-text fs-5">Branch Technical Lead | NASA Ames Research Center</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- End Card -->
          </div>
