                <p class="card-text fs-3"><em>"PyFR is a great example of what's next in classical computing. We've been using it as as a performance benchmark for years, but have now progressed to advancing its use in industrial applications to deliver a step change in modelling fidelity of turbulent flows. It's usable out-of-the-box, extensible and has a vibrant ecosystem and support community."</em></p>
