            <div class="card-transition-zoom-item">
              <img class="card-img" src="./assets/img/mars.jpg" alt="Image Description">

            </div>

            <div class="card-body">
              <h4>Martian helicopters</h4>
              <p class="card-text">Analysis and optimisation of airfoils for a next-generation Martian helicopter.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card-footer">

            </div>
          </a>
          <!-- End Card -->
        </div>
        <!-- End Col -->

        <div class="col">
          <!-- Card -->
          <a class="card card-ghost card-transition-zoom h-100" target="_blank" href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0045793021001560">
            <div class="card-transition-zoom-item">
              <img class="card-img" src="./assets/img/turb.jpg" alt="Image Description">
            </div>

            <div class="card-body">
              <h4>Low-pressure turbines</h4>
              <p class="card-text">Analysis of flow over a low-pressure turbine blade in a wind tunnel with diverging end walls.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card-footer">

            </div>
          </a>
          <!-- End Card -->
        </div>
        <!-- End Col -->

        <div class="col">
          <!-- Card -->
          <a class="card card-ghost card-transition-zoom h-100" target="_blank" href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0167610522002653">
            <div class="card-transition-zoom-item">
              <img class="card-img" src="./assets/img/build.jpg" alt="Image Description">

            </div>

            <div class="card-body">
              <h4>Architectural wind loading</h4>
              <p class="card-text">Analysis of intermitent suction peaks on a model high-rise building facade.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card-footer">

            </div>
          </a>
          <!-- End Card -->
        </div>
        <!-- End Col -->

        <div class="col">
          <!-- Card -->
          <a class="card card-ghost card-transition-zoom h-100" target="_blank" href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0960148124011601">
            <div class="card-transition-zoom-item">
              <img class="card-img" src="./assets/img/wt.jpg" alt="Image Description">
            </div>

            <div class="card-body">
              <h4>Wind turbine wakes</h4>
              <p class="card-text">Analysis of horizontal axis wind turbine wakes.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card-footer">

            </div>
          </a>
          <!-- End Card -->
        </div>
        <!-- End Col -->

        <div class="col">
          <!-- Card -->
          <a class="card card-ghost card-transition-zoom h-100" target="_blank" href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/journal-of-fluid-mechanics/article/identifying-eigenmodes-of-averaged-smallamplitude-perturbations-to-turbulent-channel-flow/EF03E2FFFF1A481FC55448B3F11496F2">
            <div class="card-transition-zoom-item">
              <img class="card-img" src="./assets/img/fun.jpg" alt="Image Description">
            </div>

            <div class="card-body">
              <h4>Channel flow eigenmodes</h4>
              <p class="card-text">Identifying eigenmodes of small-amplitude perturbations to turbulent channel flow.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card-footer">

            </div>
          </a>
          <!-- End Card -->
        </div>
        <!-- End Col -->

        <div class="col">
